# Content Structure Rules

Every page on this site follows the same predictable structure. Readers should always know where to look.

## Mandatory Page Layout

Every doc page must use this order:

```
1. frontmatter (title, description, outline)
2. 概述 (Overview)
3. 快速上手 (Quick Start)
4. 核心概念 (Core Concepts)
5. API 详解 (API Reference)
6. 实战案例 (Practical Example)
7. 注意事项 (Gotchas)
```

## Frontmatter Requirements

Every markdown file must include:

```yaml
---
title: 页面标题
description: 一句话描述页面内容（用于 SEO 和导航提示）
outline: [2, 3]
---
```

## 概述 Section

- 1 paragraph maximum
- No headings, no lists, no code blocks
- Must clearly state: what it is, when to use it, why it exists

## 快速上手 Section

- Single self-contained code block, < 20 lines
- No external dependencies beyond the browser's built-in APIs
- Must actually run in a browser console or simple HTML file
- Label it clearly: `<!-- 快速上手 -->` or `// 快速上手`

## 核心概念 Section

- Use `###` sub-headings for each concept
- Each concept: 1-3 paragraphs + code snippet
- Avoid repeating what's in 快速上手; build on it

## API 详解 Section

- Use tables for method/event/option parameters only
- Format: `Name | Type | Default | Description`
- Sort parameters by importance, not alphabetically
- Mark deprecated items with `:::warning [已废弃]` callout

## 实战案例 Section

- Real, end-to-end example
- Must include: scenario description, full code, expected behavior
- If the example requires a server or second peer, clearly state so
- Use `:::tip` to note any setup requirements

## 注意事项 Section

- Bullet points, not paragraphs
- Sort by severity: `:::danger` first, then `:::warning`, then `:::tip`
- Include browser compatibility callout using `:::tip` at the top if relevant
- Common gotchas: security restrictions, API changes, edge cases

## Linking

- Cross-links between pages use standard markdown links: `[RTCPeerConnection](/webrtc/peer-connection)`
- Prev/Next navigation: links to sibling pages at bottom of each page using VitePress `< prev/next >` or manual links
- No broken links — verify internal links before finishing a page

## Browser Compatibility

Place a compatibility callout at the top of each page under 概述:

```
:::tip 浏览器支持
WebRTC: Chrome 56+, Firefox 44+, Safari 11+, Edge 79+
Web Worker: 所有现代浏览器
:::
```
